     4832             , input string(0)
     4833             , input 1 ).
     4834         end.
     4835         run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 3, input "IBCType"
     4836           , input string( 0 ), input 1 ).
     4837         run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 3, input "IBC_EMRC"                                        ~
     4838           , input  v-attr-emrc, input 1 ).
     4839         run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 3, input "IBCUnitFactor"                                   ~
     4840           , input  string(ub.bar-code.cli-base-rate), input 1 ).
     4841         run bgelib-tag-close in this-procedure ( input 2, input "ItemBarCode") .
