     4909           , input string(v-j), input 1 ).
     4910         run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 4, input "PASBeg":U
     4911             , input Xml-CD-DateTimetoString(12/31/1989,v-subShedW:timebeg), input 1 ).
     4912           run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 4, input "PASEnd":U
     4913             , input Xml-CD-DateTimetoString(12/31/9999,v-subShedW:timeend), input 1 ).
     4914         run bgelib-tag-close in this-procedure ( input 3, input "PASched").
     4915       end.
     4916       else
     4917       do:
     4918         run bgelib-tag-open in this-procedure ( input 3, input "PASched","").
