     4985             , input string(v-promo-action:id), input 1 ).
     4986           run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 4, input "PAGCode":U
     4987             , input string(bar-code.b-code), input 1 ).
     4988           if (    v-subGood:price ne 0
     4989             and v-subGood:price ne ?)
     4990             then
     4991           do:
