     5269            , input string(ub.price-all.price-sale)
     5270            , input 1 ).
     5271         end.
     5272         else do:
     5273         run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 3, input "IBCPrice"
     5274            , input string(0)
     5275            , input 1 ).
